{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02908","headline":"奉和展礼岱宗涂经濮济 · 薛克构","name":"奉和展礼岱宗涂经濮济","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙图冠胥陆，凤驾指云亭。\n非烟泛济浦，绿字啓河汀。\n画裳晨应月，文戟曙分星。\n四田巡揖礼，三驱道契经。\n行欣奉万岁，窃拚偶千龄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛克构","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}